<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech June PPI up 0.5 pct mo/mo, 4.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech June PPI up 0.5 pct mo/mo, 4.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech producer prices were 0.5 percent higher in June, putting industrial prices 4.5 percent higher than in the same month in 1996, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Friday.  </p>
<p>  CZECH PRODUCER PRICES   JUNE 1997  MAY 1997  JUNE 1996</p>
<p>Industrial</p>
<p>  pct change month/month     0.5	  0.1	  0.1</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	 4.5	  4.1	  4.8</p>
<p>Construction prices</p>
<p>  pct change month/month     0.7	  0.8	  0.2</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	11.1	 11.0	  9.9</p>
<p>Agricultural prices</p>
<p>  pct change month/month     n/a	  n/a	  n/a</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	 0.9	 -0.7	  5.8</p>
<p>NOTE: Construction figures are based on estimates. All figures are in real, inflation-adjusted terms.</p>
<p>-- Alan Crosby, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
